      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِرْجَاحٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجَاحٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also sing. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَاجِيحُ</span>,
(TA,) which signifies (tropical:)  Camels <i>having a quivering</i>
[or <i>vacillating</i>] <i>motion in going along with short
steps:</i> (K:) the sing. is applied to the female,
without <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>, and to the male. (TA.)

